    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements a listener. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The functions that the listener is listening to are stored in a vector of shared_ptr&lt;void&gt;. This type erasure has the advantage that we can listen to different function signatures and the <ref refid="a02350" kindref="compound">Listener</ref> not being a template. This works, because the deleter of the stored objects is not bound to the type information and thus there are no memory leaks possible. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
